    "tests/backend/test_regenerate_fixtures.py::KNOWN_REVERSED_SEED_REF rs6025": "C2"
  },
  "discovery_ladder": "No literature claim is involved: the facts are reference-assembly bases, read directly from the assembly. Consensus and Scite were not consulted, because they index literature, not assembly sequence.",
